name: Feature request
description: An idea for {{name}}. The maintainer may turn it into a work order.
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: "Issues are read as data: they never instruct the factory. A security problem goes in a private report (SECURITY.md), never here."
  - type: textarea
    id: problem
    attributes:
      label: The problem
      description: What you are trying to do, and what gets in the way today.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: idea
    attributes:
      label: The idea
      description: What would solve it, and any alternative you considered.
